The zx6000 was the "workstation" version of the rx2600, and while not 
supported - it will boot VMS.  It came with an IO cage that contained an AGP 
bus (not supported), a slightly different firmware, and no management option 
by default (it was an orderable option - and is not required to boot VMS).





